            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133785+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19",
            "text": "The ban caused a widespread debate, largely on the Internet, in which rabbis and scholars from around the world participated.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133785+00:00"
          },
          {
