            "chunk_id": "semeval-9098",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:e642c43abc7c2162c2b900710b27a9ec980d7c89f95a184404a0f29d815e8ba6",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133799+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19",
            "text": "A mother was seen to have built a small raft out of birch bark for her and her children, but it promptly sank among the ice floes.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133799+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19-semeval-9444",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19-semeval-9444",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9444",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:79e1e5f28e6ecfabebc7a35a57c3a6c87758a47aedda7b948f19a966f1d99bc3",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133803+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19",
            "text": "Both squads battered the opposing goaltender with a continuous flurry of shots.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:35:12.133803+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r1-b19-semeval-9859",
